{{TABLE:methods_held_out}}

Detection (stage-1 R1 persistence): held-out TP 100, FN 4, FP 2, TN 2; precision 0.980, recall 0.962, FNR 0.038, FPR 0.50 (2/4; only 4 no-fault scenarios — extremely imprecise).

Always-abstain (post-hoc, trivial): P2 = 63/108 = 0.583, P1 = 0/45, coverage 0. V2 is -0.028 below it on P2 (95 % CI [-0.145, +0.102], McNemar p = 0.76).
